			successive hit weighs less.
			TEST WEAPON (exact replica of its study source).
			'''
	}

	FragmentoSupernovaStaff: {
		DisplayName: Supernova Fragment
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The winged singularity made servant: the winged eye with
			phantom echoes orbiting and breathing around it (its signature).
			VOLLEY of 5 nova bursts in a fan · TELEGRAPHED beam of 900px (×2.5)
			· fire flower when each burst dies · no mana cost.
			MINION: takes 1 minion slot · never expires.
			TEST WEAPON (replica of the winged singularity boss).
			'''
	}

	BolsaHuespedes: {
		DisplayName: Bag of Guests
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The test replicas: the void tentacle, the supernova
			fragment and the astral cuts. Right click.
			Only delivers what you're missing.
			'''
	}

	MetronomoPulsar: {
		DisplayName: The Pulsar Metronome
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The weapon that fires ON BEAT: the pulsar above your head ticks every 0.5s.
			PERFECT (±0.05s): guaranteed crit + double fan.
			GOOD (±0.1s): guaranteed crit. Off beat: the combo resets.
			8 hits in a row: THE LIGHTHOUSE — 3s of sweeping 900px beam.
			TEST WEAPON — no mana cost.
			'''
	}

	VelaSolar: {
		DisplayName: The Solar Sail
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Hold: the photon sail unfurls and fire rate climbs
			from 12 to 30 shots/s with heat (damage ×1 → ×1.6).
			At full heat: FUSION — 1.5s of ×2 plasma, then the sail melts (3s).
			Releasing in time keeps ~70% of the heat.
			TEST WEAPON — no mana cost.
			'''
	}

	GuadanaDesgarro: {
		DisplayName: The Rend Reaper
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The slash flies 220px and where it dies it opens A VERTICAL REALITY FISSURE (2s):
			everything crossing it bleeds, and enemy projectiles that touch it
			VANISH — it devours them and their damage joins YOUR NEXT SLASH.
			Right click: the fissure opens right at your cursor (≤480px).
			TEST WEAPON — no mana cost.
			'''
	}

	EgidaNova: {
		DisplayName: The Nova Aegis
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Left click: THE BASH — shield strike with knockback 9.
			Right click: RAISE GUARD (0.3s): a hit inside the perfect window
			DOES NOT EXIST — it detonates THE NOVA (3× + burn + 1s invulnerable).
			A guard that expires without a parry stuns you 0.5s. 8s cooldown (visible ring).
			TEST WEAPON — no mana cost.
			'''
	}

	EcoCuantico: {
		DisplayName: The Quantum Echo
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Each pulse flies and decoheres into a seed that re-emits as an ECHO
			against the nearest enemy (60% · 36% · 21.6%: 2.17× per full chain).
			Right click: THE RESONANCE — all live seeds fire AT ONCE (5s cooldown).
			TEST WEAPON — no mana cost.
			'''
	}

	VerboPrimordialStaff: {
		DisplayName: The Primordial Word
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The word that spoke the first light — SEVEN MOVEMENTS:
			I THE PULSE · II THE SEAL · III THE CROWN · IV THE STORM
			V THE FIRE · VI THE REND · VII THE SYMPHONY
			Each movement speaks with the libraries of the house; damage climbs ×1.0 → ×1.4
			and at the seventh second: THE DETONATION (2.5× + burn).
			TEST WEAPON — no mana cost.
			'''
	}

	BolsaApuestas: {
		DisplayName: Bag of Bets
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The five bets of the house (rhythm, cadence, zone,
			parry and echo) and THE PRIMORDIAL WORD that binds them. Right click.
			Only delivers what you are missing.
			'''
	}

	EsenciaDelReyGelatina: {
		DisplayName: Essence of King Slime
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The sweet soul of the rolling throne.
			Raises the Eternal Grimoire ONE WHOLE LEVEL.
			'''
	}

	EsenciaDelOjoDeCthulhu: {
		DisplayName: Essence of the Eye of Cthulhu
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The hungry vigil, dreaming of you.
			Raises the Eternal Grimoire ONE WHOLE LEVEL.
			'''
	}

	EsenciaDeDeerclops: {
		DisplayName: Essence of Deerclops
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The ancestral frost of the walking winter.
			Raises the Eternal Grimoire ONE WHOLE LEVEL.
			'''
	}

	EsenciaDeLaAbejaReina: {
		DisplayName: Essence of the Queen Bee
		Tooltip:
			'''
			Royal honey with a sting.
			Raises the Eternal Grimoire ONE WHOLE LEVEL.
			'''
	}

	EsenciaDelDevoradorDeMundos: {
		DisplayName: Essence of the Eater of Worlds
		Tooltip:
			'''
			A hundred corrupted maws on one thread.
			Raises the Eternal Grimoire ONE WHOLE LEVEL.
			'''
	}

	EsenciaDelCerebroDeCthulhu: {
		DisplayName: Essence of the Brain of Cthulhu
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The reflections that scream in red.
			Raises the Eternal Grimoire ONE WHOLE LEVEL.
			'''
	}

	EsenciaDeSkeletron: {
		DisplayName: Essence of Skeletron
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The curse copied freehand.
			Raises the Eternal Grimoire ONE WHOLE LEVEL.
			'''
	}

	// v6.50.61 — THE PURGE: the FOUR wardens' essences died with
	// their bosses (Hollow Titan, Rift Keeper, Stellar Archer, First
	// Bearer) — only the soul of the grimoire itself remains.
	
	EsenciaDeAethon: {
		DisplayName: Essence of Aethon
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The soul of the Eternal Grimoire — the page the book
			tears from itself upon falling defeated: THE TEST passed.
			Raises the Eternal Grimoire ONE WHOLE LEVEL.
			Only 10 per world: not even the book surrenders twice.
			'''
	}

	FormaAscendidaItem: {
		DisplayName: The Ascended Form
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The aura of the grimoire itself breathing around you.
			Aethon dropped it upon closing its test: the worthy
			bearer wears the light of the book.
			The sky's column open above your head, the grand double
			halo with its crown of stars, the seraph's wings behind
			your back, the scriptures beneath your feet and golden
			feathers falling along your path — the whole apotheosis.
			'''
	}

	FormaAscendidaDosItem: {
		DisplayName: The Ascended Form 2
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The absolute apotheosis of the second light.
			The eleven layers of the Ascended Form, elevated — plus THE
			MANDORLA framing you, THE TWELVE-STAR CROWN, THE SEVEN
			CANDLEHOLDERS at your back and THE RIVER OF LIGHT beneath your feet.
			The seraph wings with TWICE the feathers and the FULL extension
			from top to bottom: above your head and below your feet.
			And INFINITE FLIGHT (like its sister).
			'''
	}

	FormaAscendidaTresItem: {
		DisplayName: The Ascended Form 3
		Tooltip:
			'''
			THE THRONE — the third light: canonical celestial divinity.
			THE RAINBOW round about the throne spinning in two rings,
			THE SEA OF GLASS beneath your feet, THE SEVEN LAMPS OF
			FIRE orbiting you, and THE OPHANIM WHEELS — wheels of
			eyes of light turning against each other. And behind you,
			THE CROSS OF LIGHT of the Maiestas Domini: the pillar of
			heaven and the arm of the horizon.
			The seraph wings with their 28 PRISMATIC feathers — every
			feather, its own color of the rainbow.
			And INFINITE FLIGHT (like its two sisters).
			'''
	}

	FormaAscendidaCuatroItem: {
		DisplayName: The Ascended Form 4
		Tooltip:
			'''
			THE SERAPH — the fourth light: THE BURNING ONE (Isaiah 6).
			THE SIX WINGS — two covering your face, two covering your
			feet, and two you fly with. THE BURNING BODY with its
			tongues of fire, THE TRIPLE HALO with the trisagion ("holy,
			holy, holy"), THE CROWN OF THE KING OF GLORY with its
			spikes and jewels, THE RAYS OF GOD turning behind you,
			THE HOLY MIST filling the temple, and THE SHINE of the heart.
			The greatest light of all four forms — the burning one ILLUMINATES.
			And INFINITE FLIGHT (like its three sisters).
			'''
	}

	// v6.50.54 — THE RAINBOW HALO (Form 3's rainbow, distilled into an adornment).
	HaloArcoirisItem: {
		DisplayName: The Rainbow Halo
		Tooltip:
			'''
			FORM 3'S RAINBOW, DISTILLED (Rev 4:3).
			No throne, no cross, no sea of glass: JUST THE BAND of
			seven stripes — small, around your head, slowly turning
			with its twelve zodiac pearls of color.
			The throne's ring, made an adornment. And a soft white light.
			'''
	}

	// v6.51.3 — THE RUNIC SUNS' SHINE (the 4-point twinkles of 3+ ring suns, made an adornment).
	BrilloSolarItem: {
		DisplayName: The Runic Suns' Shine
		Tooltip:
			'''
			THE RUNIC SUNS' SPECIAL SHINE, DISTILLED.
			Only THE 4-POINT TWINKLES of three-ring suns and beyond —
			two crossed strokes of incandescent white and their golden
			heart, being born and dying around you.
			A piece of sun, walking the world.
			'''
	}

	BrasaDelEclipseItem: {
		DisplayName: The Eclipse Ember
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The fourth type of aura: the darkening MIST.
			Double-Perlin black smoke at the edges, molten GOLD in
			the middle and a beating RED core — light, mist, blur,
			distortion, bloom and glow, ALL by code.
			'''
	}

	BolsaCategoria: {
		Titulo: "[c/{0}:{1}]"
		Linea1: "[c/E6B0FF:Right-click to deploy this category of the arsenal]"
		Linea2: "[c/FFD66B:Only delivers what you're missing — reopen it whenever you lose a weapon]"
		Nota: "[c/78788C:{0}]"
		Abierta: The {0} opens: {1} new items.
		Completa: The {0} is already complete with you.
	}

	// v6.51.4 → v6.51.5 — THE SIX WORTHY CANDIDATES of the Grimoire (one weapon
	// per idea: the binary, the commas, the page, the eye, the line and
	// the bookmark) + THE BAG that delivers them.
	DignosEquinoccioBinario: {
		DisplayName: The Binary Equinox
		Tooltip: ""
	}

	BolsaProyectilesDignos: {
		DisplayName: The Bag of Worthy Projectiles
		Tooltip: ""
	}

	// v6.50.99/.102 — THE FOURTH WEAPON — DUAL OPTION B — THE CHOSEN ONE
	Equinoccio: {
		DisplayName: The Equinox
		Tooltip:
			'''
			"Half dawn, half eclipse."
			THE CHOSEN ONE — DUAL OPTION B: two vanilla Nightglows per shot.
			THE GOLDEN one leaves with SUNLIGHT: pulsing golden halo and eight
			spinning rays. THE BLACK one is a clean eclipse: dark disc with a
			pulsing violet rim and shadowflame sparks (the mist is gone).
			Day and night part above your head... then they hunt.
			No mana (test weapon).
			'''
	}

	// v6.50.99/.102 — THE EMPRESS BAG — bag 20 (the chosen one)
	BolsaEmperatriz: {
		DisplayName: Empress Bag
		Tooltip:
			'''
			The chosen one of the Empress of Light projectile study:
			THE EQUINOX — day and night in a single book. The other three
			trials (the cosmic clone, the echo and the verdict) served their
			purpose and were retired.
			Right-click to deploy it. Only delivers what you're missing.
			'''
	}

	// v6.50.128 — LA ESENCIA CORRUPTA (la comida del altar)
	ItemCorrupto: {
		DisplayName: Corrupted Essence
		Tooltip:
			'''
			What remains of an item after the FALLING ALTAR's beam.
			Not used by hand: it is FOOD for the Eternal Grimoire.
			Drop it back onto the altar and the book will eat it…
			as long as its bearer is nearby.
			'''
	}

	// v6.50.130 — THE CRATER MIST (the invisible item that IS the
	// mist: the portable corruption altar)
	BrumaDelCrater: {
		DisplayName: Crater mist (relic)
		Tooltip:
			'''
			A RELIC of the old fall: the mist that was once an altar.
			THE ARRIVAL no longer needs it — corruption lives in your crafting
			menu while you carry the grimoire, and the Eternal devours any
			corrupted weapon you drop with it in hand.
			'''
	}

	ArmaCorruptaTag: Corrupt
	ArmaCorrupta1: +5% to ALL its stats — more damage, more knockback, faster swings.
	ArmaCorrupta2: It no longer accepts prefixes or reforging — the anvil is closed to it.
	ArmaCorrupta3: Drop it with the grimoire IN HAND: the Eternal will devour it.
}

