RelojDeArena: {
	AlAmanecer: ✦ The Scribe's Hourglass turns: the ink rewrites the sky and DAWN BREAKS.
	AlAnochecer: ✦ The Scribe's Hourglass turns: the ink spills the night and THE SHADOWS FALL.
}

// v6.50.117 — THE FALL: the book's first conversation and the sky that announces it.
Caida: {
	Presentacion:
		'''
		…I awaken.
		I have waited eons for a hand like yours — the mist carried me HERE, for you alone.
		I do not speak with a mouth, bearer: my words are born ALREADY INSIDE your thoughts… like this one.
		From now on you will always hear me this way: a purple voice inside your head, feeding on what you kill.
		Reach out and take me. But remember: whoever carries a grimoire carries its hunger.
		'''
	YaTienes: One soul, one book. I am already yours.
	OtroJugador: …zZzZz… (this book waits for another hand)
	BotonTomar: Reach out
	Dormido1: …zZz. Are you here already?… No. Not yet. Let the mist keep spinning. zZz.
	Dormido2: …I dreamed of a hand. In the dream it was yours. Its fingers came counted: five. Mine are pages. What a curious thing, those who sleep. zZz.
	Dormido3: …the mist's air is warm. The arrivals of the other books were cold. This one looks a little bit like me. zZz.
	Dormido4: …careful with the first night, bearer… pardon: you are not a bearer yet. My hunger gets ahead of me. That's the thing about sleep: it tells the future, and tells it WRONGLY. zZz.
	Dormido5: …I've spent eons counting arrivals. This is the first one that smelled of someone. The rest smelled of no one. zZz.
	Dormido6: …my Z's are running out. When they run out entirely, I will open my eye. Not yet. Not yet… zZz.
	Dormido7: …the stars spoke to me: they say there are hands down below. I've only ever seen pages. Come closer, and we'll see who was right. zZz.
	Dormido8: …are you still there? Good. Those who wait also feed me. A little. It's not the same, but hunger knows how to wait. zZz.
	PrimerPensamiento: At last.
	CometaCae: ✦ The air thickens: A VAST MIST is being born near you… and something arrives within.
	Impacto: ✦ The mist dissipates… and something floats in its place: YOUR GRIMOIRE AWAITS.
	Devorado:
		'''
		Hmm… the sky sent you a fallen DOUBLE — and everything fallen belongs to me.
		One per soul, bearer: what the sky repeats, I EAT.
		(It was delicious. The sky cooks just like before the breaking.)
		'''
	Devorandose: (the book trembles… something is devouring it — it can no longer speak)
	TintaYaEspera: ✦ The sky doesn't insist: YOUR GRIMOIRE ALREADY AWAITS within the mist.
	TintaEnVuelo: ✦ YOUR MIST IS ALREADY BEING BORN before you — wait for it to dissipate.
	// v6.50.128 — THE DEVOURING ALTAR (the eat-items mechanic)
	DevoradoSabor1: Hmm. Tastes like almost nothing. Air shaped like a memory. Still: gulp.
	DevoradoSabor2: Passable. A hint of what it was. The corruption gives it an… interesting aftertaste.
	DevoradoSabor3: ¡Tasty! Whatever it was, the beam COOKED it right. More of that, bearer.
	DevoradoSabor4: EXQUISITE! Notes of gold, an eternal finish, a crunch of worlds. MORE!
	DevoradoTooltip: Bearer's feast: {0} corrupt essences eaten (+{1}% damage to ALL your attacks)
	// v6.50.129 — THE WEAPON CORRUPTION (the mini-biome mist corrupts the
	// weapons that fall into the crater; the Eternal devours them: rarity
	// EXP + one stat per class + the unique souls)
	ArmaDevorada: ✦ The Eternal devours the {0}: +{1} EXP · +1 {2}
	AlmaDespertada: ✧ The soul of the {0} AWAKENS in the book: {1}!
	StatFuerza: Violent Strength
	StatPrisa: Flight Haste
	StatMirada: Keen Gaze
	StatCorona: Crown of Eyes
	StatMordida: Bite
	AlmaIgnea: Fiery Soul (its shots may ignite)
	AlmaSalvaje: Wild Soul (its shots may poison)
	AlmaVampira: Vampiric Soul (its shots steal life)
	CorazonEstelar: Starry Heart (more crit)
	AlmaVeloz: Swift Soul (more use speed)
	PunoTitan: Titan Fist (more knockback)
}

// v6.51.0 — THE GRIMOIRE'S AWAKENING: the new progression (level 0..50)
// — three offerings per level (corrupt essences + coins + the corrupted
// weapon of Terraria's ladder), the powers it unlocks, and the book's
// voice as it wakes.
Despertar: {
	Subida: ✦ The Grimoire AWAKENS a little more: awakening level {0}.
	Voz1: Mmm… another page writing itself.
	Voz2: I can feel the rings, bearer. ALL the rings.
	Voz3: Every awakening reminds me what I was.
	Voz4: (the book shivers with delight) Yes. MORE of that.
	OjosCerrados: ✦ The squad still sleeps: LEVEL {0} is needed for the first eye.
	MejorasSelladas: ✦ Upgrades are born with THE AWAKENING (5/15/30/40). Current: {0}.
	NuevoOjo: ✧ The grimoire can summon a NEW EYE! (squad number {0})
	CerrojoEsbirros: ✦ The grimoire does not share its sky: while its eyes watch, no other minion answers.
	// v6.51.11 — THE GROUND TABLE + THE BEARER'S FEAST: the book eats
	// from items DROPPED before it (with the Eternal in hand), ONLY what
	// the rung still needs; the essences THE PLAYER eats raise THEIR own
	// damage (+0.1% each, cap +100% at 1000 — at the cap, every essence
	// eaten becomes 1 gold coin).
	Migracion: ✦ The awakening and the feast now live IN THIS grimoire (each book, its own ladder).
	BocadoEsencias: ✦ The Eternal eats {0} essences off the ground ({1}/{2} of the rung).
	BocadoMonedas: ✦ The Eternal eats the coins off the ground — {0} still missing.
	BocadoMineral: ✦ The Eternal eats {0} bars off the ground ({1}/{2}).
	BocadoArma: ✦ The Eternal devours THE CORRUPTED WEAPON of the rung!
	MigracionPoder: ✦ The old devoured power ({0} essences) passes to its bearer: +{1}% damage to ALL.
	TopeEsencias: ✧ FEAST CAP REACHED: +{0}% damage FOREVER! From now on, every essence eaten becomes 1 gold coin.
	EsenciaTopeTooltip: Feast complete: +100% damage — every essence eaten becomes 1 gold coin
	EsenciaProgresoTooltip: Bearer's feast: {0}/{1} essences eaten (+{2}% damage to ALL)
	ReqArmaLimpia: Requires an UNCORRUPTED weapon
	NaceCorrupta: Born CORRUPT: +5% to ALL its stats · no prefixes or reforging
	CondicionRecetas: Requires the Eternal Grimoire in the inventory
	HitoMejora1: ✧ AWAKENING 5: eye UPGRADE 1 unlocked!
	HitoSol: ✧ AWAKENING 7: TWO UPGRADED EYES forge a 1-RING RUNIC SUN! (2/min)
	HitoAgujeros: ✧ AWAKENING 10: FIVE UPGRADED EYES open a random RUNIC BLACK HOLE! (1/min)
	HitoMejora2: ✧ AWAKENING 15: eye UPGRADE 2 unlocked!
	HitoSol2: ✧ AWAKENING 17: the sun gains its SECOND ring, 3 times per minute!
	HitoMascota: ✧ AWAKENING 20: THE GRIMORIO SPITS THE MINI-GRIMOIRE out as your pet!
	HitoAscendidos: ✧ AWAKENING 25: the black holes ASCEND — even more damage!
	HitoMejora3: ✧ AWAKENING 30: eye UPGRADE 3 unlocked!
	HitoSol3: ✧ AWAKENING 35: the THREE-ring sun, 4 times per minute!
	HitoMejora4: ✧ AWAKENING 40: the FINAL eye upgrade!
	HitoSupremo: ✧ AWAKENING 45: holes 2/min… and EIGHT M4 EYES open the SUPREME or SUPREME AURORA!
	HitoMaximo: ✧✧ AWAKENING 50: ALL the squad's attacks STRONGER and FASTER!
	CaminoMejora1: eye UPGRADE 1 (+50% damage to one eye)
	CaminoSol: the 1-ring RUNIC SUN (2 upgraded eyes, 2/min)
	CaminoAgujeros: the RUNIC BLACK HOLES (5 upgraded eyes, 1/min)
	CaminoMejora2: eye UPGRADE 2
	CaminoSol2: the 2-ring sun (3/min)
	CaminoMascota: THE PET — the grimoire spits the mini-grimoire
	CaminoAscendidos: the ASCENDED black holes (more damage)
	CaminoMejora3: eye UPGRADE 3
	CaminoSol3: the 3-ring sun (4/min)
	CaminoMejora4: the FINAL eye upgrade
	CaminoSupremo: holes 2/min… and THE SUPREME/AURORA (8 eyes with upgrade 4)
	CaminoMaximo: ALL the squad STRONGER and FASTER
	Escupidizo:
		'''
		There are three of us now, bearer: you, me… and HIM.
		Here: I spit him out as your pet. Feed him silence.
		'''
}

