Jefe: {
	Resonancia: You absorbed {1} resonance shards from {0}!

	// v6.50.61 — THE PURGE: Titan.Furia, Rift.*, Arquera.* and
	// Portador.Furia died with their bosses.
	
	Aethon: {
		Fase: Aethon — PHASE {0}: {1}
		Nombre1: The Stardust
		Nombre2: The Song of Time
		Nombre3: The Gravity
		Nombre4: The Loom
		Nombre5: The Verdict
		// v6.50.57 — GRAVITY DIED (the letter: the boss must STOP bending
		// gravity) — its announce retired with it.
		Recordar: AETHON REMEMBERS — the runes he memorized from you return to their owner.
		Reconocimiento: THE TEST IS CLOSED: the grimoire declares you worthy. THE ASCENDED FORM falls at your feet.
		Muerte: The book CLOSES and its light returns to the pages. The sun takes back its course.
		Carga: THE FLASH — light crosses the world: stay off its line.
		Juicio: THE JUDGMENT OF LIGHT — pillars of light fall from the sky: run.
		Nova: THE PRIMORDIAL NOVA — the light bursts: find the gap.
		Aliento: THE PRIMORDIAL RAY — the light hunts you.
		// v6.50.46 — THE ECLIPSE IS DEAD ("the light goes out and only the
		// bullets shine, it looks bad, remove it") — its successor: THE VORTEX.
		Vortice: THE PRIMORDIAL VORTEX — the light swirls around you: move with the maelstrom.
		// v6.50.45 — THE FIVE NEW WEAPON ANNOUNCES
		Reloj: THE COSMIC HOURGLASS — time falls from the sky: don't fly beneath its weight.
		Coro: THE SPECTRAL CHOIR — the notes sing around you: move with the ring.
		Manada: THE ASTRAL PACK — the light unleashes the hounds of heaven: kill them or outrun them.
		Telar: THE CONSTELLATION LOOM — the stars weave the cage: get out of the figure.
		Decreto: THE DECREE OF THE ECLIPSE — the circle RIDES WITH THE GOD: outrun it or leave its shadow NOW.
		// v6.50.53 — THE USER'S IMAGE, MADE AN ATTACK: THE RADIANT BURST
		Estallido: THE RADIANT BURST — all the light in the world gathers and ERUPTS: get outside the ring.
		// v6.50.54 — THE THREE NEW EMPRESS WEAPONS (the research)
		Danza: THE SUN DANCE — the god's rays spin: walk BETWEEN the light, with the turn.
		Lanzas: THE ETHEREAL LANCES — light aims WHERE YOU'RE GOING: break the straight line.
		Corona: THE EVERLASTING CROWN — the rainbow besieges you: move with the feathers.
		// v6.50.57 — THE SPECIAL ATTACK: THE GOD BECOMES A SUN AND THROWS IT
		Sol: THE SUN OF THE GOD — Aethon BECOMES a sun and HURLS it: get away from the red giant.
		// v6.50.120 — FUSION AS A PHASE + THE FINAL BOSS'S THREE WEAPONS
		// (the final-boss research: Moon Lord, the Lunatic Cultist, Duke
		// Fishron — the Complete Memory devours them all).
		Fusion: THE MEMORY IS MADE WHOLE — both fragments embrace: HALF the fight is dead, the whole god awakens.
		Rayo: THE PHANTASMAL JUDGMENT — the memory's rays sweep crossed: walk BETWEEN the blades of light.
		Ritual: THE COUNCIL OF MIRRORS — the ring of bolts closes where you STOOD: leave the circle before the embrace.
		Tormenta: THE ABYSS STORM — the vortices advance spitting spirals: move between the whirlpools.
	}

	// v6.50.120 — THE BAG TO YOUR HAND (the user's letter).
	BolsaCria.Entregada: THE BROOD BAG REACHES YOUR HAND — BOTH pets sleep inside: the light hatchling and her dark twin.
}

Esencia: {
	SinLibro: The soul looks for an Eternal Grimoire in your hotbar — the book is the one who tastes it.

	// v6.50.30 — EACH WARDEN'S OWN FLAVOR (the user's letter: dialogs
	// must match the boss the essence belongs to): the book's voice
	// tastes the soul of ITS boss — 3 samples each (EcoLib.ElegirClave
	// never repeats the last one).
	Sabor: {
		KingSlime1: The King goes down sweet and whole: a gelatin throne digested in three swallows.
		KingSlime2: Tastes of crown and melted sugar. Royalty ALWAYS falls soft.
		KingSlime3: The King digested: his crown is my page now. Next?
		EyeofCthulhu1: The Eye finally closes its lid… inside me. Tastes of tired vigilance.
		EyeofCthulhu2: A whole eye: the closest thing to drinking the moon in one gulp.
		EyeofCthulhu3: The pupil was the last to dissolve. It WATCHED me until the end.
		Deerclops1: Ancestral frost on the palate… the walking winter, digested.
		Deerclops2: A truly cold soul: it froze MY hunger for a whole heartbeat.
		Deerclops3: The antler went down slowly. One-in-a-hundred rarity: worth EVERY swallow.
		QueenBee1: Royal honey with a sting: sweetness with consequences. It burns going down.
		QueenBee2: The whole Queen tastes of honeycomb and gala venom. A ROYAL feast.
		QueenBee3: Sting digested, hive in a page. It buzzes when the page turns.
		EaterofWorlds1: A devourer devoured. The whole world fits in one page IF you chew right.
		EaterofWorlds2: A hundred corrupt maws on a single thread… tastes of sick soil.
		EaterofWorlds3: He devoured worlds; I devour devourers. I am the chain.
		BrainofCthulhu1: The Brain thinks… inside me. Its reflections still scream in red.
		BrainofCthulhu2: Tastes of gray matter and panic. Foreign thoughts CRUNCH.
		BrainofCthulhu3: A whole mind digested: for one tick, I thought in PINK.
		Skeletron1: The curse copied freehand, letter by letter, bone by bone.
		Skeletron2: Tastes of dungeon, mold, and one old broken promise.
		Skeletron3: His bones still recite. The curse is a page now: I write it MYSELF.
		// v6.50.61 — THE PURGE: the flavors of HollowTitan,
		// RiftKeeper, EchoArcher and EchoBlade died with their bosses.
		AethonBoss1: AETHON. The grimoire itself, digested. Tastes of the beginning of everything… and of myself.
		AethonBoss2: I TESTED you and lost to my own bearer. Tastes of forgiveness — a flavor I had never tasted.
		AethonBoss3: The test was mine; the victory, yours. When the book closed, the sun blinked for ONE tick.
	}

	CofreSeco: "{0}'s chest of souls is DRY in this world — ten pages, story closed."
	UltimaAlma: "{0}'s LAST soul fell. Its story in this world is complete."
}

